  "limits": [
    "No independent PCB revision comparison, component-marking survey, UART voltage/pinout measurement or JTAG access test.",
    "Matching current FIT/DTB and NAND geometry do not prove every component on both routers is identical.",
    "Saved current G6 FITs are HJL.L91; inactive IJL.J03 software is not a separate physical hardware inventory.",
    "U-Boot console state and compiled serial policy differ. The owner set console=1 on the first unit; an absent variable does not diagnose absent UART hardware.",
    "USB PHY nodes and a JTAG block-diagram label do not prove accessible connectors or usable interfaces.",
    "No complete socket-to-NI/MDIO map, independent Wi-Fi bring-up, throughput benchmark or secure-boot trust-state audit is asserted."
  ],
  "dt_property_encoding": "Text properties are arrays of NUL-separated strings. Other property values are hex-encoded original bytes; integer cells use the DT big-endian encoding. An empty hex string represents a zero-length boolean property."
